com/uk/global-privacy-notice/ <br>EEA - https://www.ajg.com/se-en/eea-privacy-notice/ <br><br>If you are providing us with personal data of another individual, you must tell them you are providing this to us and show them a copy of this notice. Please contact me if you do not want to receive direct marketing information from us. <br><br>This e-mail and any attachments are CONFIDENTIAL and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the intended recipient of this e-mail message, please telephone or e-mail us immediately, delete this message and do not copy, distribute or use the information in this message or any attachments. <br><br></body></html>", "from_email": "ahardy@evolinbroking.com", "to_email": "rebecca@onebodyoutbound.com", "stats_id": "195131f4-dd04-4a3e-a4af-f4bd634903d4", "cc": ""}]

