[{"kind": "sent", "timestamp": "2026-09-04 10:44:56.272000+00:00", "message_id": "<e08bf410-f470-478e-9023-8a5a85e72b53@onebodyldnworks.com>", "body": "<div>Hello Zoe,</div><br><div>I noticed your Thinkbox London office is about 4 min walk from our Holborn clinic.</div><br><div>Reason I'm writing: if Thinkbox gives you private health cover, physio is almost certainly included in it.&nbsp;Most people barely touch it. I run One Body LDN. 38 physio locations across London, 7,764 reviews at 4.9, and we see a lot of people from big companies like KPMG, Deloitte and PwC.</div><br><div>So if something's nagging like lower back from sitting, neck, shoulder, a knee that complains when you run, we'll do your provider side from start to finish. Booking and paperwork. Most people are surprised to find nothing comes out of pocket.</div><br><div>And if you haven't got cover, your first 55-minute session with hands-on treatment is on us anyway. Want me to send you the booking code? Just reply and it's yours.</div><br><div>Thanks</div><div><div>Rebecca Bossick</div><div>Clinical Director @ One Body LDN</div></div>", "from_email": "rebecca.bossick@onebodyldnworks.com", "to_email": "zoe.harkness@thinkbox.tv", "stats_id": "e08bf410-f470-478e-9023-8a5a85e72b53", "cc": ""}, {"kind": "reply", "timestamp": "2026-09-04 10:45:04+00:00", "message_id": "<a49d78e8f1e6442abb8c96a2636c58d8@DU4PR05MB12986.eurprd05.prod.outlook.com>", "body": "<html><head>
