ubject:</b> our nearest clinic to your office</span></p></div><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:12.0pt">Hello Ben,</p><p class="MsoNormal">I want to give you a 45-minute session with an HCPC-registered physio, completely on me. Proper hands-on treatment, and you'll know what's actually going on by the end of it.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">I'm reaching out because our Wimbledon clinic is the nearest one to your Hawes &amp; Co office. We've got 43 locations across London. We treat a lot of people doing more or less your job, from KPMG, PwC and Deloitte among others. We fix backs, necks, shoulders, knees. Mostly from sitting.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Check out my company in the signature for more info. Just reply and I'll send you the booking code.</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Thanks</p><p class="MsoNormal">Rebecca Bossick</p><p class="MsoNormal">Clinical Director @ One Body LDN</p><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p></blockquote></div></body></html>", "from_email": "ben.butler@hawesandco.co.uk", "to_email": "rebecca.bossick@onebodyreach.com", "stats_id": "3841e967-f5ed-4d50-91c7-73a3c50b5b5a", "cc": ""}]

